{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1679","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Typical Party in Dorm"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Today is a holiday in the residence hall — Oleh arrived, in honor of which the girls gave him a string. Oleh liked the gift a lot, so he immediately thought up and offered you, his best friend, the following problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$, which consists of the first $$$17$$$ lowercase Latin letters {$$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$\\ldots$$$, $$$p$$$, $$$q$$$} and question marks. And $$$q$$$ queries. Each query is defined by a set of pairwise distinct lowercase first $$$17$$$ letters of the Latin alphabet, which can be used to replace the question marks in the string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The answer to the query is the sum of the number of distinct substrings that are palindromes over all strings that can be obtained from the original string $$$s$$$ by replacing question marks with available characters. The answer must be calculated modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Pay attention!"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" Two substrings are different when their start and end positions in the string are different. So, the number of different substrings that are palindromes for the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be $$$4$$$: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider examples of replacing question marks with letters. For example, from the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba??ee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" when querying {$$$a$$$, $$$b$$$} you can get the strings "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ababaee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abaaaee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" but you cannot get the strings "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pizza"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" abaee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba?fee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba47ee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abatree"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recall that a palindrome is a string that reads the same from left to right as from right to left."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 1\\,000$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the string $$$s$$$, which consists of $$$n$$$ lowercase Latin letters and question marks. It is guaranteed that all letters in the string belong to the set {$$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$\\ldots$$$, $$$p$$$, $$$q$$$}."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains a single integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is followed by $$$q$$$ lines, each containing a single line $$$t$$$ — a set of characters that can replace question marks ($$$1 \\le |t| \\le 17$$$). It is guaranteed that all letters in the string belong to the set {$$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$\\ldots$$$, $$$p$$$, $$$q$$$} and occur at most once."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query print one number — the total numbers of palindromic substrings in all strings that can be obtained from the string $$$s$$$, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\nab??aba\n8\na\nb\nab\nabc\nabcd\nabcde\nabcdef\nabcdefg\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n14\n13\n55\n105\n171\n253\n351\n465\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"